# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Caliph Scorpidsting
  tip Ride south-east to Waterspring Field. Caliph stands in the middle of the southern Wastewander camp: clear around him first.
  tip Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.
  collect 8723 x1 quest 2781          -- Caliph Scorpidsting's Head

step The Gaping Chasm
  tip Ride south past the Broken Pillar to the Gaping Chasm, the Hazzali tunnels; Scrimshank's gear lies deep inside.
  tip Careful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds.
  collect 8593 x1 quest 10            -- Scrimshank's Surveying Gear; below ground

